                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 120,
                                          "content": "\"We were dealing with multiple disconnected systems that led to a lot of duplicate data entry. We needed a partner who could help us streamline and connect everything, and MindCloud delivered.\"",
