                                              "type": "text",
                                              "id": "Jzoc0",
                                              "name": "\"This team is highly capable of building",
                                              "context": "blockquote",
                                              "fill": "#ffffff",
                                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                              "width": 584,
                                              "height": 160,
                                              "content": "\"This team is highly capable of building custom solutions to extraordinarily difficult problems. MindCloud built a custom connector to replace a previously issue-ridden one — providing more reliable performance with built-in transparency reporting.\"",
